{"last_link_id": 22, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [13], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [140, 26], "pos": [1722.2138671875, 74.24470520019531], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 12, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 11, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [19], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [1891.472900390625, 73.79838562011719], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 16, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 17, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 13, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["🌈 kontext最大的优点就是控制强度和画面效果非常好。\n\n🦋 缺点就是不支持中文，且有一套严谨的提示词使用方式，无法直接搭配翻译使用，需要按照规定语法进行命令输出。但不用担心，我已经输入好了该工作流的通用指令，无特殊要求，无需更改，直接使用即可开始抽卡。\n\n✍ 本工作流初次制作于2025年6月kontext生态大冲洗的时间。\n---\n\n和风工作流节点颜色简易区分：\n-\n\n- 💎蓝色为需求输入和结果获取；\n\n- ✅绿色为根据需求更换；\n\n- 💜紫色为注意参考；\n\n- ☝黄色为尽量不更改；\n\n- ❌红色为绝对不要更改；\n\n- 🔗灰色为其他默认链接框架。\n\n---\n\n特俗情况使用，请参考下面的Flux Kontext提示词技巧：\n\n## Flux Kontext 提示词技巧\n\n使用英文\n\n### 1. 基础修改\n- 简单直接：`\"Change the car color to red\"`\n- 保持风格：`\"Change to daytime while maintaining the same style of the painting\"`\n\n### 2. 风格转换\n**原则：**\n- 明确命名风格：`\"Transform to Bauhaus art style\"`\n- 描述特征：`\"Transform to oil painting with visible brushstrokes, thick paint texture\"`\n- 保留构图：`\"Change to Bauhaus style while maintaining the original composition\"`\n\n### 3. 角色一致性\n**框架：**\n- 具体描述：`\"The woman with short black hair\"`而非`\"她\"`\n- 保留特征：`\"while maintaining the same facial features, hairstyle, and expression\"`\n- 分步修改：先改背景，再改动作\n\n### 4. 文本编辑\n- 使用引号：`\"Replace 'joy' with 'BFL'\"`\n- 保持格式：`\"Replace text while maintaining the same font style\"`\n\n## 常见问题解决\n\n### 角色变化过大\n❌ 错误：`\"Transform the person into a Viking\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Change the clothes to be a viking warrior while preserving facial features\"`\n\n### 构图位置改变\n❌ 错误：`\"Put him on a beach\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Change the background to a beach while keeping the person in the exact same position, scale, and pose\"`\n\n### 风格应用不准确\n❌ 错误：`\"Make it a sketch\"`\n✅ 正确：`\"Convert to pencil sketch with natural graphite lines, cross-hatching, and visible paper texture\"`\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n`\"Change [object] to [new state], keep [content to preserve] unchanged\"`\n\n**风格转换：**\n`\"Transform to [specific style], while maintaining [composition/character/other] unchanged\"`\n\n**背景替换：**\n`\"Change the background to [new background], keep the subject in the exact same position and pose\"`\n\n**文本编辑：**\n`\"Replace '[original text]' with '[new text]', maintain the same font style\"`\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "工作流概览", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [545.11669921875, 1186.307373046875], "pos": [-257.1108703613281, -564.8748168945312], "id": 19, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["👉       【各大模型出图商用原则】\n-\n1. 需严格遵照作者对模型的商业许可范围声明综合判断，具体如下：\n- ❌如底模出图不可商用，则创作的图片不可商用。\n- ❌如底模出图可商用，但搭配的 LoRA 出图不可商用，则创作的图片不可商用。\n- ✅如底模出图可商用，且搭配的 LoRA 出图可商用，则创作的图片可商用。\n---\n\n2. 需严格遵照工作流的作者对工作流和模型的商业许可范围声明综合判断，具体如下：\n- ❌如工作流作者声明出图可商用，但工作流中涵盖的模型是其他作者的不可商用模型，则不可商用，侵权行为与工作流作者无关。\n- ✅如工作流提供的作者声明出图不可商用，但工作流中没有涉及API，且使用的模型为可商用，节点也是开源节点，则创作的图片只要你不承认自己是抄袭的工作流，即可商用。虽不道德但不侵权。这种事要小心被曝光，或者遇见搅屎棍。\n- ✅如工作流声明出图可商用，且使用的模型声明可商用，则创作的图片可商用。\n---\n\n3. 出图内容需严格遵照国家法律，如果违背或侵权，应承担对应的法律责任。其中包括但不限于的具体内容有下：\n- ❌故意输入可能侵犯第三方知识产权或其他权益的关键词或提示词，导致生成的图片可能侵犯第三方知识产权或权益的，该图片不得用于商业用途，且用户应承担由此产生的全部侵权责任。\n- ❌出图人物侵犯他人肖像权，且没有证据自证者，图片不得商用。\n- ❌出图内容为18禁的内容，或者明确为黄赌毒的宣传标语，图片不得商用，若经传播，应承担相应法律责任。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "和风友情提示", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [393.98455810546875, 523.682373046875], "pos": [-717.9437255859375, -165.50042724609375], "id": 18, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [7, 12], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["change the image to a professional photo, remove imperfections. professional light, high details, best quality"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 5, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270.68414306640625, 138.42100524902344], "pos": [1419.1427001953125, -49.5815315246582], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [10], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [197.712890625, 46], "pos": [1715.424072265625, 0.3331747353076935], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 7, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "latent", "link": 8, "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 9, "type": "ReferenceLatent", "prope